        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>This component acts as the parallel storage warehouse (our barrels) for the neural network. It decodes a single 9-bit 
sequential loop counter address (0 to 258) to simultaneously look up model weights across four independent, 8-bit 
signed channels. Each channel uses paired low and high-nibble ROM blocks, preparing class parameters for 
immediate accumulation.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="300" y="-20"/>
    </visualElement>
